{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://noomesh.ai/schemas/noo-model-set-1.json",
  "title": "noo-model-set/1: a catalog model set (model-set.json)",
  "description": "The manifest the controller writes last when it stages a model set (a named, versioned directory of files in the controller store). The manifest IS the catalog entry; the gateway's noo_model_catalog row is a projection of it. Signed: a detached signature over the exact bytes of model-set.json by the fleet bundle signing key (see docs/reference/node-workloads.md, 'Signing'). The rules a schema cannot state are in x-noo-rules. Canonical fixtures: tests/fixtures/i300/model-sets/ (cases.json lists the stable refusal code for each). JSON null is refused on every field (this format has no nullable field), and so is a repeated object key; every validator must match. Design: noomesh-internal proposals/i300 section 3.",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": [
    "format",
    "id",
    "revision",
    "kind",
    "modality",
    "runtime",
    "source",
    "license",
    "files",
    "needs"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "format": {
      "const": "noo-model-set/1"
    },
    "id": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/id"
    },
    "revision": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._-]{0,127}$",
      "description": "Upstream commit or content hash. A path component of the set directory, so never . or .."
    },
    "kind": {
      "enum": [
        "voice",
        "voice-pack"
      ]
    },
    "modality": {
      "enum": [
        "speech-to-speech",
        "stt",
        "tts"
      ]
    },
    "runtime": {
      "type": "array",
      "minItems": 1,
      "maxItems": 8,
      "items": {
        "type": "string",
        "pattern": "^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9._-]{0,63}$"
      },
      "description": "What the set is loadable BY: opaque strings a worker's model slot declares it accepts."
    },
    "source": {
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "hf"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "hf": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "required": [
                "repo",
                "ref",
                "digests"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "repo": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._-]{0,95}/[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._-]{0,95}$"
                },
                "ref": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{40}$",
                  "description": "A pinned commit sha, never a branch."
                },
                "digests": {
                  "enum": [
                    "authenticated",
                    "operator-trusted-local"
                  ],
                  "description": "authenticated: sha256 values come from upstream LFS metadata the controller could read. operator-trusted-local: HF redacts LFS digests on gated repos for anonymous callers, so the operator supplied or accepted the digests; `trust` is then required."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "local"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "local": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "required": [
                "verified"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "verified": {
                  "type": "boolean",
                  "description": "true: staged against an operator-supplied expected manifest. false: staged with --trust-local (source: local-unverified)."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "license": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "id",
        "url",
        "accept"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._+-]{0,63}$"
        },
        "url": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^https://[^\\s]{1,500}$"
        },
        "accept": {
          "enum": [
            "none",
            "operator"
          ]
        },
        "accepted": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "by",
            "at"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "by": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 128
            },
            "at": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}T[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}(\\.[0-9]+)?(Z|[+-][0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2})$",
              "description": "RFC 3339."
            }
          }
        },
        "notice_files": {
          "type": "array",
          "maxItems": 16,
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/path"
          },
          "description": "Paths of license/attribution texts shipped with the set; each must appear in files."
        },
        "additional": {
          "type": "array",
          "maxItems": 8,
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "id",
              "url"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._+-]{0,63}$"
              },
              "url": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^https://[^\\s]{1,500}$"
              }
            }
          },
          "description": "A second attribution upstream requires (for example the license of the underlying weights)."
        }
      }
    },
    "files": {
      "type": "array",
      "minItems": 1,
      "maxItems": 64,
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "path",
          "bytes",
          "sha256"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "path": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/path"
          },
          "bytes": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 1099511627776
          },
          "sha256": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"
          },
          "role": {
            "enum": [
              "weights",
              "notice",
              "config"
            ],
            "default": "weights",
            "description": "notice and config files are staged and verified like any file but are not what the worker loads."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "needs": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "profiles",
        "cpu_fallback",
        "arch"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "profiles": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 1,
          "maxItems": 8,
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "name",
              "accel"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "name": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9-]{0,31}$"
              },
              "accel": {
                "enum": [
                  "cuda",
                  "cpu"
                ]
              },
              "min_compute": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^[0-9]{1,2}\\.[0-9]$",
                "description": "CUDA compute capability, e.g. 8.0."
              },
              "vram_mb": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 1,
                "maximum": 1048576
              },
              "ram_mb": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 1,
                "maximum": 4194304
              },
              "per_slot_vram_mb": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 1,
                "maximum": 1048576
              },
              "realtime": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "description": "false: loadable but cannot serve live audio; placement never picks it for a realtime workload."
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "cpu_fallback": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "arch": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 1,
          "maxItems": 4,
          "items": {
            "enum": [
              "amd64",
              "arm64"
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "fits": {
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "model"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "model": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/id"
            },
            "revision": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._-]{0,127}$",
              "description": "Optional: pin the pack to one revision of the model."
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "runtime"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "runtime": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9._-]{0,63}$"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "trust": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "by",
        "at",
        "reason"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "by": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 128
        },
        "at": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}T[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}(\\.[0-9]+)?(Z|[+-][0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2})$"
        },
        "reason": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 500
        }
      },
      "description": "Who vouched for digests the controller could not authenticate upstream, and why. Required when source.hf.digests is operator-trusted-local or source.local.verified is false."
    }
  },
  "$defs": {
    "id": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9._-]{0,63}$"
    },
    "path": {
      "type": "string",
      "maxLength": 129,
      "pattern": "^(?!(\\.|\\.\\.)(/|$))(?!.*/(\\.|\\.\\.)$)[A-Za-z0-9._-]+(/[A-Za-z0-9._-]+)?$",
      "description": "Relative, no . or .. component, at most one directory level, charset [A-Za-z0-9._-]."
    }
  },
  "x-noo-rules": [
    "fits is REQUIRED when kind is voice-pack and FORBIDDEN otherwise; trust is REQUIRED when source.hf.digests is operator-trusted-local or source.local.verified is false (both stated above in allOf).",
    "file paths are unique within the set; model-set.json itself is not a file of the set.",
    "every license.notice_files path appears in files; a file with role notice or config is never mounted as the model slot's weights.",
    "source.local.verified=false is shown by `noo models list` as local-unverified and may be refused by a node policy.",
    "license.accept=operator: staging refuses until the operator accepts; `accepted` {by, at} is then written into the manifest and the audit log. accept=none must not carry `accepted`.",
    "A profile with accel=cuda should state vram_mb; min_compute is only meaningful for accel=cuda.",
    "The signature is not a field: it is the detached file beside the manifest (model-set.json.sig), see docs/reference/node-workloads.md.",
    "JSON null is refused on every field with field_type (the schema's types already refuse it; Go's decoder would read it as an absent value). This format has no nullable field. A repeated object key is refused with duplicate_key.",
    "An unknown field is refused everywhere (additionalProperties false): a node from before a minor addition must refuse the set, not half-load it."
  ],
  "allOf": [
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "kind": {
            "const": "voice-pack"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "kind"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "required": [
          "fits"
        ]
      },
      "else": {
        "not": {
          "required": [
            "fits"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "required": [
          "source"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "source": {
            "required": [
              "hf"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "hf": {
                "required": [
                  "digests"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "digests": {
                    "const": "operator-trusted-local"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "required": [
          "trust"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "required": [
          "source"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "source": {
            "required": [
              "local"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "local": {
                "required": [
                  "verified"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "verified": {
                    "const": false
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "required": [
          "trust"
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
